  <figure>
    <img src="/assets/images/area-history/1901-pan-american-exposition/169-gnd-exterior-cover.jpg" alt="Historic image from the 1901 Pan-American Exposition &quot;Glimpses of ND&quot; page">
  </figure>
</div>

<p>The commission issued a 60-page booklet titled <em>Glimpses of North Dakota</em>. Prepared by {% person "david-bartlett" %}David Bartlett{% endperson %}, it was engraved and published by Buffalo-area printer Gries &amp; Co. Mandan and Morton County were featured prominently, while Bismarck and Burleigh County were entirely absent.</p>

